<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;color:#334155;">Hi <%= @user.first_name.presence || "there" %>,</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;color:#334155;"><%= @business.name %> moved from <%= @from_plan %> to <%= @free.name %> because <%= Billing::LAPSES.fetch(@reason, "its paid plan ended") %>. Nothing has been deleted: your clients, quotes, jobs and invoices are all there, and anything beyond <%= @free.name %>'s limits is read-only until you choose a paid plan again.</p>
